#: scenario3:scenario3_A2E216FA_4C95_43F9_B3F6_A9DC168A11F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fbbcb3df7519c899aadfe1268d3682a959a373dcf44e98ff1c455229a8d7bc6f
#. default-sha256: 40098fe44d1d88e1425311686f89faec1d21b695e86bbad2929de1a989566d68
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A2E216FA_4C95_43F9_B3F6_A9DC168A11F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Approximately a week had passed since then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Environ une semaine s’était écoulée."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CAFDA7DB_FB10_4C06_B482_922B43D1B95E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37139068d64310ba0a2f8d7a1479b92d6e1cb45d974b5766e5758dc428e27733
#. default-sha256: 4af384b921f918d36e75e995b1537d48d1d98e53aff423ad39730b4c66bad8e2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CAFDA7DB_FB10_4C06_B482_922B43D1B95E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl was, as usual, spending her time in her room reading, staying inside "
"the house. ⟪k:1⟫Then, Maria barged in."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Fille aux Cheveux Blancs passait son temps, comme d’habitude, à lire dans sa chambre et "
"ne sortait pas de la maison. ⟪k:1⟫C’est alors que Maria fit irruption."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4FA7383C_DECE_4819_A7A8_B98BAFCD2BA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2456faad8bf21d39aefd21c56b34c979c0992d5e6684cb2d436fc73aef80230b
#. default-sha256: 428eff168f97ac7ace65f6291b6bb1c9f84cc1393b8f2003e751d98fd06bd456
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4FA7383C_DECE_4819_A7A8_B98BAFCD2BA8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Madam! ⟪k:4⟫Madam!⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Madame ! ⟪k:4⟫Madame !⟪k:5⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C05CAF9C_E7FB_4252_8F73_93B193AC5AA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a05e82474037d0490f2fa6218e159cc419892bb22174fe28038dacb0646f698
#. default-sha256: 3ecfa3994abe433418400780b2414ba86e251502279846c7b08605230dabd2e0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C05CAF9C_E7FB_4252_8F73_93B193AC5AA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Oh my. You’re out of breath. What happened?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Ciel, vous êtes tout essoufflée. Qu’est-ce qui se passe ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C8DD4FDD_FA29_4704_BD2E_EE0F0369819F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 981775e6b0a8bc7a8045117171a576b45d628fd473037b9b4d8858aab2e83a01
#. default-sha256: 5459d7b53610ce7e29092ab3d5336e5f13045e481836f21f40bce03e8e5e9701
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C8DD4FDD_FA29_4704_BD2E_EE0F0369819F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“What happened” is we have a ⟪k:2⟫big problem⟪k:3⟫!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Th-⟪k:6⟫The garden... ⟪k:7⟫"
"The rose garden!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ce qui se passe, c’est que nous avons un ⟪k:2⟫gros problème⟪k:3⟫ !⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫L-⟪k:6⟫Le "
"jardin... ⟪k:7⟫Le jardin de roses !"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3DCD861F_058E_40BE_AE8A_3310153AA948
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2f39a0c1cbdafe468ef41a51d8d70ec52c85f02844285652b4bde0f7dba037b
#. default-sha256: 3764a4e544b9a9d4c3bc0e519b91bf637bf98977d2f6d4cc32b0ec5ff10567ab
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3DCD861F_058E_40BE_AE8A_3310153AA948"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The garden...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Le jardin...?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A65CC86E_007C_44B2_81AA_69D1D601CC5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1e8c29697f5a7bc4c17e966409554b09596221290f106aa25be5290b0796655
#. default-sha256: 26d8c30f983c54e10dde77aab1f7eee6ba8611ecbd71cb0177c2453a94012fcc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A65CC86E_007C_44B2_81AA_69D1D601CC5B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All the roses you put so much love and care into growing are being chopped down! We’ll "
"lose them all if we don’t hurry!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Toutes les roses que vous aimez tant sont en train d’être coupées ! On va toutes les "
"perdre si on ne se dépêche pas !"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C451D8F3_79C5_477C_BD07_33A30387DFC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e99bb3e8e46cc72b262ee44c486f73b9b907837693ae33e1d07072e7ede91444
#. default-sha256: 5fe5d36542b112d1b7275b43037f4dace539f9f70d4cce66cfb8c380597ddd7e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C451D8F3_79C5_477C_BD07_33A30387DFC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_53625603_D41C_4F94_BDBB_CA19473AA8F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ddf412d652247c85ea5974e6d16f62e71b71a3770b08d660ea2cc72baef91cb7
#. default-sha256: 56fc947cee23b9960c1c6103bc2a9b5678a4072490a863d6a620b6511217d15d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_53625603_D41C_4F94_BDBB_CA19473AA8F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Upon hearing the news, the White-Haired Girl dashed from her room and toward "
"the garden, with Maria following close behind."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫En apprenant cela, la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs se précipita hors de la pièce "
"et fonça jusqu’au jardin, Maria sur ses talons."

#: scenario3:scenario3_48F55368_9472_4E29_9F2C_EF5E121ADF2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6d6a856e419ace6198347526cfd32fad98f2ac9133d2d49e60544708e72c136
#. default-sha256: 86fbb883c2f4f0529790c734ebc85deadd27695ef875bb75def1b61f4a652667
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_48F55368_9472_4E29_9F2C_EF5E121ADF2F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫When she arrived, she saw a dozen or so sweaty, rugged men at work, Jacopo "
"shouting orders."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫À⟪k:4⟫ son arrivée, elle vit une dizaine d’ouvriers en sueur et Jacopo qui "
"criait des ordres."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9FA0374A_0D3A_4740_847F_DA872E153643
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d82cd86de12cad6a930712427bfb76f9ca9aecc84198040ae3afbddba7c0731d
#. default-sha256: 1978d7140a789cf347688eede9deff235a1c0d4cae53d4299d3f6a9bdea15337
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9FA0374A_0D3A_4740_847F_DA872E153643"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The men clearly had no concept of how much a single flower was worth, no concern whatsoever "
"for their beauty..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ l’évidence, ces hommes n’avaient aucune idée de la valeur d’une fleur et ne se "
"souciaient absolument pas de leur beauté..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_12875B8E_D8B4_47A3_80A2_186F2DD16547
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae7274dcf6ade820ed7094f91b14a9e504e3e1eb86e0617f81685e7219efc109
#. default-sha256: 21a0d49b1879b7586d8b376e01b9d117c3c7eeb3ad6874ee60859cdb93a0d988
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_12875B8E_D8B4_47A3_80A2_186F2DD16547"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫for they mercilessly, thoughtlessly hacked away at the shrubs like they were naught but "
"weeds."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...car ils taillaient, désinvoltes et sans pitié, les massifs, comme si c’était de la "
"vulgaire mauvaise herbe."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E6CFDC0C_D817_4D18_99EA_0B6A2BF3C150
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f504b773230fe66f9fe016103494d5a6733b06f12fb521fe340bbe2281774ee3
#. default-sha256: 45bd3d6e42b07e8538e68a04deeb827817e861ed96ec7e59fe9319cd2e43a1c2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E6CFDC0C_D817_4D18_99EA_0B6A2BF3C150"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Each flower they tore from the earth extinguished another of the many lives the White-Haired "
"Girl had put so much time and effort into tending for."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Chaque fleur qu’ils arrachaient de la terre était pour la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs une vie "
"qui s’éteignait, la vie d’êtres auxquels elle avait consacré tant d’attentions et d’efforts."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9B51C402_245E_46EF_B8EF_ED930F083B75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17bcef71a7c1e817e9eb752aeb4374ee929f39d007da852525c1fe6fc5511936
#. default-sha256: ee1f6245ff175c7b3906f56512307f05c5f44c7bc9b94e6af9cf11ec677af77f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9B51C402_245E_46EF_B8EF_ED930F083B75"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫J-⟪k:9⟫Jacopo, what are you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫J-⟪k:9⟫Jacopo, qu’est-ce que tu—"

#: scenario3:scenario3_12CAB4FA_B234_4881_8F80_676ADCF249FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bba832188b8319dfba97cd3f5ab86d14d0c70354e5d6b8fb337cbf4914e94197
#. default-sha256: 121139df1f0c8b740e65495218cee4efebf7968e54ed882fd7dd335e5107e6e0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_12CAB4FA_B234_4881_8F80_676ADCF249FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, hello, Maria.⟪k:2⟫I didn’t expect you would come with her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah, bonjour, Maria.⟪k:2⟫Je ne m’attendais pas à ce que tu viennes avec elle."

#: scenario3:scenario3_321047B4_09F0_4FA6_9559_0C9EE017413B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5bbd94ea4492c9c73217d7d70e3ddb7216b1ea7cc29485e77779b3991762279
#. default-sha256: 2d19d04767b722dff71bb644e8c9ae5f48cc7abc53285e65085f1e51c9829643
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_321047B4_09F0_4FA6_9559_0C9EE017413B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why... ⟪k:2⟫would you do..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Pourquoi... ⟪k:2⟫faites-vous..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_15CF168C_7991_4E09_AAD1_452A22D77F03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4332a0965edcb63bc13dee38278a6cac5caa3e509bc2a1a0f654804c28e4477
#. default-sha256: af878940d133c569a1a063edd509e674f463d37ac854d59c65f9970b9208534a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_15CF168C_7991_4E09_AAD1_452A22D77F03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why? Why, it goes without saying.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫This house has no need of a garden."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Pourquoi ? Eh bien, cela va sans dire.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Cette maison n’a nul besoin d’un jardin."

#: scenario3:scenario3_542FEA29_0476_4C94_9B2E_17895E87ADA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65400b8b1649d01310e5fde48003c184c31747a825f3219a8b7eba071d685831
#. default-sha256: 5dc029dcafd6be1e4ab132e8629fc7047221359132db166a93b28cfcae4d3481
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_542FEA29_0476_4C94_9B2E_17895E87ADA3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Damn flowers have no place here.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Might as well do something worthwhile with "
"the soil."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ces fichues fleurs n’ont rien à faire ici.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Autant faire quelque chose d’utile "
"du sol."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2BBABD5D_EC2D_4C5B_8F85_9C624B9FD8BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95eee92bba8341e8eccbe0a7ba4ef31d0a542e599f9df70a48d95c76a7e664bb
#. default-sha256: fc30a0cf492618da42cb177ad4a2654d77f1c06ae7b8b4e7f367336ad65edc59
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2BBABD5D_EC2D_4C5B_8F85_9C624B9FD8BB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A miniature railroad would be a better use of the space,⟪k:2⟫and certainly a great deal "
"easier on the eyes.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I could even get my hands on some genuine wheels."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Un chemin de fer miniature conviendrait beaucoup mieux à cet endroit, et ce serait "
"certainement plus agréable à regarder.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Je pourrais peut-être même mettre la main sur de "
"vraies roues."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B207666D_936B_44C9_9C7C_CE9F92B6EFF5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21d4fb579c5399abd0b3d29302410296712ef1a7e0eed29886f7d9c6b160bf4e
#. default-sha256: 4bafa52b57200e8b95f6869a193a0cf317adecfc4260b3e5585e3e1044d6999e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B207666D_936B_44C9_9C7C_CE9F92B6EFF5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The same wheels being used on the revolutionary transcontinental railroad. ⟪k:1⟫Ten or "
"twenty years down the line, they’ll be worth a fortune."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les mêmes roues que celles de la révolutionnaire ligne transcontinentale. ⟪k:1⟫Dans dix ou "
"vingt ans, elles vaudront une fortune."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AFAEDCEF_79E1_4394_AD30_CF7351C71165
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67906e45d4979bba4822c82bc9e6b6f4f63a204dcd3bb90d42d546f2b90a24ed
#. default-sha256: d8151c77861f8b3b582b9496d74b77b4ba3eaf7cfad89a8cfe34bdb45b680d06
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AFAEDCEF_79E1_4394_AD30_CF7351C71165"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Jacopo..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Jacopo..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DAE31A6D_DB82_4758_862E_40C74C135399
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dedad235379f5f248af3400fec41e8d252e2f3453044901e103ea54e3abcef5b
#. default-sha256: bdba560cf4299c0491661e37a16a1a24d5aed31a6c4e91ab9d02b79ee98722c6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DAE31A6D_DB82_4758_862E_40C74C135399"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You know... ⟪k:2⟫how much this garden meant to me, don’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vous savez... ⟪k:2⟫combien je tenais à ce jardin, non ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2646F604_F527_40E7_8C94_706205D6CCD2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0586405ab3b59b90312e3229e085b4583a5abdf5be801c44b98b36a56bf4448
#. default-sha256: b10d82a68a4d62c3150b0936b91ec0a6453ec8e4e51fd231ecb20cc3c4dfeb9e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2646F604_F527_40E7_8C94_706205D6CCD2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"

#: scenario3:scenario3_38620622_641D_4020_97D5_437267C3BE03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5650003ca220f03103821e9e687678edd9792a6aa6c69722a3ca60d81ab5a29
#. default-sha256: 25f98f2bd94fbf9d494ed7b70265b3c27c0d27a25ff45c61ed63741b402a33c2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_38620622_641D_4020_97D5_437267C3BE03"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Did it honestly have no place here?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Flowers have a calming effect on people. "
"They give you peace."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫N’avait-il vraiment pas sa place ici ?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Les fleurs apaisent les gens. Elles "
"nous donnent la paix de l’esprit."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ECB13A2E_A293_4572_871D_76EC1EEE57E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa95a8e8adbe1b9d358365056b4b550d865bd29241662e5260c7cb87c3505860
#. default-sha256: 5796e77a773bd608dccc290d52e08361007c7f1175164735bfdcf5b89af05168
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ECB13A2E_A293_4572_871D_76EC1EEE57E7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They are not, by any means, worthless—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elles ne sont absolument pas inutiles—"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B898FD4B_CEAE_48CC_AEA1_1455042F2569
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 974403030d1111984a7e449da7f729342d94ebedb7918fc8019307ab1f5dd003
#. default-sha256: 10f133cc3a92bd6b9df56c5a4ef0c5555f15dff06ab5b80720a5428b1c9c7205
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B898FD4B_CEAE_48CC_AEA1_1455042F2569"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So you’re saying that white rose was your passive-aggressive way of telling me to “calm "
"down”?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vous êtes en train de me dire, si je comprends bien, que la rose blanche était votre "
"manière, l’air de rien, de me dire de me « calmer » ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_17B55CEE_966A_4E2A_A7B5_113B47328E10
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea967baac202045e9edc534bc05aa35124e19e6afdbfa8c21cbb4f40c76f53ca
