msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫—! Not at all! I simply thought you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫—! Pas du tout ! Je voulais simplement—"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5B2DBEF9_7106_4D29_BF8C_F5C7BB17FF43
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce9d498c96a90d12954f2ebe9fda289ab97c19966fcd5157d55a0bb4ad27aed8
#. default-sha256: b7b68ba13934f2cd2a0cc405b2483e4d944ffe5e9153053beb7510d62cd59050
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5B2DBEF9_7106_4D29_BF8C_F5C7BB17FF43"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫At the end of the day, you’re just using them for your own purposes—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫to trick "
"and deceive."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫En fin de compte, vous les utilisez seulement dans votre propre intérêt—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ pour "
"manipuler et tromper votre petit monde."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F751B1C5_87D9_495F_A07A_86AA8933AF31
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a542c8523a853c1e5617496fa41ce2b39c8b169bc314e08d989621525d5544c1
