msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0B0D3046_CA98_404F_BFCC_3CD9980268FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 224b335e67d248f7b513b3c1a7f7ff8b6cd6d2b6252e758cf2482458ec9bb842
