msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0B0D3046_CA98_404F_BFCC_3CD9980268FD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫With that rose arch out of the picture, we’ll have a much better view. ⟪k:2⟫There won’t "
"be anything blocking the sun any longer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫En enlevant cette arche de roses, on aura une bien meilleure vue. ⟪k:2⟫Plus rien ne "
"viendra masquer le soleil."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BB050BA5_C3D2_4FF0_B282_9E74BDFFEFBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09378cb9c669978739f83647ff3d1fa63f81f6ce18325e5a21be4d47ba7c791d
#. default-sha256: 004e3962d7f78828f1b41c153c483daad266a3822ea701b22bdb03fd8dee1366
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BB050BA5_C3D2_4FF0_B282_9E74BDFFEFBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Weren’t you supposed to be sensitive to sunlight?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Spend too much time out here "
"and you’re liable to fall ill."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vous n’êtes pas censée être sensible au soleil ?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Si vous passez trop de temps "
"dehors, vous allez tomber malade, c’est sûr."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CDAC70DC_BEF6_456F_97B2_F46E91647DC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6db8b51ec543e03c7ad7929d520b89bb278cf8efea9b1185f73c733432aa57fd
