msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The poor thing, though she did not say a word, was surely thinking,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫La pauvre enfant pensait sûrement, même si elle n’en disait pas un⟪k:4⟫mot :"

#: scenario3:scenario3_199C1E3F_5208_408E_B782_D56BD7305B39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 145b365f5ccdac2e14585652a68cd945b88ef044cf143ffe5f202b48ac66a12b
#. default-sha256: 3395fc817b21a3be506fdcb5f81e6f4636866f75e1288e18d2e483e3fb19bcd1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_199C1E3F_5208_408E_B782_D56BD7305B39"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫“Are you truly that determined to rob me of my sanctuary?”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫« ⟪k:1⟫Ê⟪k:2⟫tes-vous vraiment si résolu à me priver de mon sanctuaire ? »"

#: scenario3:scenario3_CA1406A6_68E7_420E_8297_978A9FA34DE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66cc0dad6289703ec85aed086d7526a085571e4758cbae55168601812b07e87a
#. default-sha256: bf92b1e1acac36a38bb01ab0d62970ab9559dfd244b90cbbee2122c28143d57b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CA1406A6_68E7_420E_8297_978A9FA34DE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The words twirled around in her head, unable to make the final journey to her lips. She "
"stood there, looking down at her own feet as her husband marched off..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les mots tourbillonnaient dans sa tête, sans réussir à franchir la barrière de ses lèvres. "
"Elle resta immobile et baissa les yeux tandis que son mari s’éloignait d’un pas vif..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EBA9086F_5D46_44D1_AFC2_6781C81A9E6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd63aab43d6dcb7dc9c29c92ec63ed3008fb808202eb9e2577a3bfa1769b3078
#. default-sha256: 1d65c0792072505a7f8a4d32f998bdf7402289036b0646dab39553d2865dc95c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EBA9086F_5D46_44D1_AFC2_6781C81A9E6A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and listened to the screams of the roses being reaped."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elle fut contrainte d’écouter les hurlements des roses moissonnées."

#: scenario3:scenario3_927E28C5_6C98_4A06_A65C_B8944EE19E6D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30b8b4c107cd5d684bc8865d54a21aea6cf96cca91678f38fb108997c5e48c25
#. default-sha256: 7f4529074710ef9af3a1d260e1bd7d420ba16f2fb2506922cff2eb6666667ce5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_927E28C5_6C98_4A06_A65C_B8944EE19E6D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫After being torn down by Jacopo, the garden reverted to a state of ruined desolation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Après avoir été rasé par Jacopo, le jardin retourna à l’état de ruines."

#: scenario3:scenario3_79874CDC_E128_434D_93B8_7FAC2FA40F2B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b318124b6e0477c7b016ece8690898c1e4eff56d2c2057789ab1144389f2c8b2
#. default-sha256: 5458fb5315e32eb92b0623145501c044209aab62d7646493f288a0afa538e3c8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_79874CDC_E128_434D_93B8_7FAC2FA40F2B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A shame, after all the work that went into restoring it to the beauty it had under the "
"flaxen-haired family."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quel dommage, après tous les travaux de restauration qu’il avait subis pour lui rendre sa "
"beauté d’antan."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AFDAB351_6FD0_4860_BF80_181134F8729D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9edda40a7fd1724389a7a2974b95b84d624468ffad2914fc3b966973b3f76cdc
#. default-sha256: 87cbaabd58d7143076dfda8c176a5613c5cf697d2e32813ff3f2483d3b8f269c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AFDAB351_6FD0_4860_BF80_181134F8729D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And as Jacopo had said, in its place went scraps of metal, train wheels, prototype models, "
"carbon rods."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et comme l’avait dit Jacopo, il y eut à la place de la ferraille, des roues de train, des "
"prototypes miniatures et des tiges de carbone."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2352417E_64FD_4241_BDC4_5261059AA706
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ced1e290b1ac74b0bb983a550bf114650b84155180db8f9a2bfd2a6c4476990d
#. default-sha256: ed2edf743c9152ec7e67d7352dc5f7ad357c4fcfdf625535f2cab4f8fbf5ef0a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2352417E_64FD_4241_BDC4_5261059AA706"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫These items may have had value for him, but I certainly do not think it was worth robbing "
"his wife of a place that made her feel comfortable just so he could store them there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ces objets avaient peut-être de la valeur pour lui, mais je ne crois pas que cela valait la "
"peine de spolier son épouse d’un endroit qui la rendait si heureuse, juste pour les stocker."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B6CF7A65_EC65_4D7C_AF85_6AA49A616898
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8d3109595b24511ea2165f418e36648368071e4b95cc5ae1cb450229958dbf2
#. default-sha256: 250378296f0968b904f95902a1e6e2005014f8924db87119123fdf8c899ee3a4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B6CF7A65_EC65_4D7C_AF85_6AA49A616898"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Besides, I was rather fond of the rose garden myself.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The roses seemed to evoke a "
"sense of nostalgia in me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫En plus, j’aimais moi-même beaucoup le jardin de roses.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Les roses suscitaient un "
"sentiment de nostalgie en moi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_37511A7E_68F1_413D_A27E_340C4758AA23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f43fdac5a3e89705d10abf4ed8171516bffc60f49909a33a212c0886c0f9330d
#. default-sha256: 438ec2606db2419f72657c7cd15a27b63bc04dd2802b79590dbf1924e7a9d970
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_37511A7E_68F1_413D_A27E_340C4758AA23"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I felt as though, somewhere far beyond the edge of my memories,⟪k:1⟫I had seen another "
"garden of roses,⟪k:2⟫modest though it may have been."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’était comme si, dans les tréfonds de ma mémoire,⟪k:1⟫j’avais vu un jour un autre jardin de "
"roses,⟪k:2⟫mais très modeste, celui-là."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E4E06865_5116_4472_9D00_B9C1BFAD32E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 022ad6e3ef3420778dc93ebb4cd583b169b815ff5ecbc75cfff3b4bf9edd573a
#. default-sha256: 5fa5ce054b76345b5a97753a0765e987def01dc215574e3887fd14ff084a5fdf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E4E06865_5116_4472_9D00_B9C1BFAD32E6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But I cannot remember when it was..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Cependant, je ne me souviens pas quand c’était..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A7238012_6A5F_4D65_9EBB_8922D34F7E49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5d91d908570e49cc2e9dbf8c5dac4bb9cf75e8ea359ea04861226e090d65001
#. default-sha256: 291573510e9ccd84417ce6e0d750e4ee7262e226fb23b13b6bc3040fa0f66c98
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A7238012_6A5F_4D65_9EBB_8922D34F7E49"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Does that come as a surprise to you? ⟪k:1⟫I am quite sure there are periods of the mansion’s "
"history of which I am not aware."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cela vous surprend-il ? ⟪k:1⟫Je suis sûre qu’il y a des périodes dans l’histoire du manoir "
"que je ne connais pas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F313D77A_1405_4E02_9BE3_D5837AFD3794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08f2e1ebc8eebdacc41845b16c6743aad995965fc25642651606e71f0ba20fa4
#. default-sha256: 4e093232783818cbee9644bb1a29a9a9651937bd11e20307e7ff7966576c6844
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F313D77A_1405_4E02_9BE3_D5837AFD3794"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But in any case, Jacopo had caused many people great pain in order to repurpose that garden "
"for himself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais en tout cas, Jacopo avait blessé beaucoup de personnes en restructurant le jardin à son "
"goût."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FEA60DD2_A735_4799_AA1D_26C227345BD0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2a744af7d1002fad0349f4bbfcfcb2d1432d0af690380cad0b56189ff96df5e
#. default-sha256: ce930ee40d2aa5e74d8544591b92e702140f93e660effa909a1be148ecaa0c93
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FEA60DD2_A735_4799_AA1D_26C227345BD0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And he continued to walk all over his wife. ⟪k:1⟫Whenever she tried to do something kind for "
"him, he would brush her off, saying, “That’s not your place.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et par la suite, il continua à malmener son épouse. ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫À⟪k:3⟫ chaque fois qu’elle "
"essayait de faire quelque chose de gentil pour lui, il la repoussait en disant « Vous n’avez rien "
"à faire ici »."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C55223D9_5795_4B6C_98B6_7358EFEEEE4F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab5058724a97ccb70da8181adfc956b84bbec8ce9eac91eeb2fb8e81841a2958
#. default-sha256: 573b0a4a6556976c7f73e44864fdc4c944701ea64016b6d162a76cfce0337512
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C55223D9_5795_4B6C_98B6_7358EFEEEE4F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He paid no mind whatsoever to the looks of dejection that rose to her face each time he "
"rejected her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il ne prêtait absolument pas attention à son air abattu à chaque fois qu’il la rejetait."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F89FDF2E_9C37_4FC5_B341_FD9968647660
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ebd162029ec44d6699a71c154ac5c996a1a0def61636c05edfe6c6c852a271a
#. default-sha256: 78b823df7e8c80dd41b77a4f526ba5a102c6b298d23402b1e455db753a589c47
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F89FDF2E_9C37_4FC5_B341_FD9968647660"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was beginning to wonder if anything she had said about the man he had been a year earlier "
"was actually true."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je commençais à me demander si le portrait qu’elle en avait brossé un an auparavant recélait "
"une trace de vérité."

